1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,360
Happy Marriage Needs Fighting For.
幸福的婚姻需要争取。

2
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:54,287
As a talented navy officer, he was bound to be busy. When his wife rang him up to say that she wanted a divorce, he was still scanning a digital counter to check the data so as to give an assessment of the theoretical framework for a biochemical weapon. His junior staff’s sympathy made him feel embarrassed.
作为一名有才能的海军军官，他注定十分忙碌。妻子打电话告诉他想离婚时，他还在查看数字计数器，核对数据，以便作出评估，评估的是一种生化武器的理论框架。下属的同情让他感到尴尬。

3
00:00:54,287 --> 00:01:31,947
His wife was a part-time clerk. With his high bonus, she lived in a grand house with elegant cushions and bedding. Her favourite pastime was reading stars’ biographies or absurd fiction with endless chapters in her armchair.
他的妻子是个兼职文员。凭着他丰厚的奖金，她住在配有雅致靠垫和寝具的大房子里。她最喜欢的消遣是读明星传记，或坐在扶手椅上读章节没完没了的荒诞小说。

4
00:01:31,947 --> 00:02:11,340
People envied her leisurely life very much. But in fact, she was tired of being left alone. She sent emails to his mailbox every week to state her thinking and ask for his accompaniment, but never received a satisfactory reply.
人们非常羡慕她悠闲的生活。但事实上，她已经厌倦了总是独自一人。她每周都给他的邮箱发邮件，表达自己的想法，希望得到他的陪伴，但从没收到满意的答复。

5
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:53,467
Tired of his explanation that he must obey the orders, she filed for divorce. Because he desired to get their holy affection back, he set other affairs aside. He trimmed his fingernails short and changed his overweight figure as well as his awful haircut.
听腻了他“必须服从命令”的解释，她提出了离婚。因为他渴望找回两人神圣的感情，他把其他事务暂时放到一边。他剪短了指甲，改变了过胖的体形，也换掉了糟糕的发型。

6
00:02:53,467 --> 00:03:28,860
He wore an apron to prepare delicious cuisine for her. He also bought her a necklace and piles of flowers hoping that their receiver could turn around. After being tested out for 3 months in all, he eventually succeeded.
他系上围裙，为妻子做可口的饭菜。他还给她买项链和一大堆鲜花，希望收礼物的她能回心转意。经过总共三个月的考验，他终于成功了。
